    "title": "Research | Nikhileswara Rao Sulake",
    "description": "Research publications by Nikhileswara Rao Sulake covering computer vision, medical imaging, multimodal learning, chest X-ray classification, lung CT segmentation, histopathology, echocardiography, OCT analysis, and responsible AI.",
