    "title": "Thyroid Nodule Analysis | Nikhileswara Rao Sulake",
    "description": "Thyroid nodule analysis with ultrasound and deep learning by Nikhileswara Rao Sulake, focused on medical image interpretation and early risk-aware detection.",
    "portfolioChrome": false,
    "html": "\r\n\r\n  \r\n\r\n  <section class=\"article-hero\">\r\n    <a href=\"#/projects.html\" class=\"hero-back-link\">\r\n      <i class=\"fas fa-arrow-left\"></i> Back to Projects\r\n    </a>\r\n    <h1 class=\"hero-title\">Ultrasound-Based Thyroid Nodule Segmentation and Risk Stratification</h1>\r\n    <p class=\"hero-authors\">\r\n      <a href=\"https://nikhil-rao20.github.io\" target=\"_blank\">Nikhileswara Rao Sulake</a>\r\n    </p>\r\n    <p class=\"hero-meta\">Research Article &nbsp;·&nbsp; Medical Imaging &nbsp;·&nbsp; Deep Learning</p>\r\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\">\r\n      <span class=\"draft-badge\"><i class=\"fas fa-pencil-alt\"></i>&nbsp; Article in Preparation</span>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <div class=\"article-body\">\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"tag-list\">\r\n      <span class=\"tag\">Medical Imaging</span>\r\n      <span class=\"tag\">Ultrasound</span>\r\n      <span class=\"tag\">Thyroid Nodule</span>\r\n      <span class=\"tag\">Semantic Segmentation</span>\r\n      <span class=\"tag\">Deep Learning</span>\r\n      <span class=\"tag\">Clinical AI</span>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"coming-soon-icon\">\r\n      <i class=\"fas fa-flask\"></i>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <h2 class=\"coming-soon-title\">Content Coming Soon</h2>\r\n    <p class=\"coming-soon-text\">\r\n      A detailed write-up covering the methodology, experiments, and results for this project is currently being prepared by the author. The article will cover deep learning approaches to thyroid nodule segmentation from ultrasound imagery and automated risk stratification aligned with clinical reporting standards.\r\n    </p>\r\n    <p class=\"coming-soon-text\" style=\"font-size:1.35rem; color:#8a9aaa;\">\r\n      In the meantime, feel free to reach out directly for a preview or early access to findings.\r\n    </p>\r\n\r\n    <p class=\"contact-text\">\r\n      <strong>Nikhileswara Rao Sulake</strong> &mdash;\r\n      <a href=\"mailto:nikhil01446@gmail.com\">nikhil01446@gmail.com</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp;\r\n      <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/nikhileswara-rao-sulake/\" target=\"_blank\">LinkedIn</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp;\r\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/Nikhil-Rao20\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub</a>\r\n    </p>\r\n\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  \r\n\r\n  \r\n\r\n  \r\n  \r\n  \r\n  \r\n  \r\n\r\n",
